think Name discipline (comlink-tendency): sheaf is already the seated-proposed ecosystem brand (a bundle of grain stalks = the whole Grain), so a fact-batch cannot reuse it; batch is the clear, safe, unclaimed word and is TigerBeetle's own — grepped free of any seated module name
